OL,3,GNEWSAPoultry farmers warn bird flu
OL,4,Arules may hit sales
OL,5,
OL,6,FSellers of poultry products say they
OL,7,Fare worried about sales after a
OL,8,FNational Housing Order by the UK's
OL,9,FChief Veterinary Officer.
OL,11,FThe order came into force on 13
OL,12,FNovember following an outbreak of
OL,13,Faviation flu.
OL,15,FIt means anyone who gives away or sells
OL,16,Feggs or poultry products, as well as
OL,17,Fthose who keep 50 or more birds, must
OL,18,Fkeep the animals indoors.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
