OL,3,GNEWSAPoultry farmers warn bird flu
OL,4,Arules may hit sales
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I don't know whether we will continue
OL,7,For whether this might be the end of
OL,8,Ffree-range turkeys as such," said
OL,9,FMargaret Warmington, who co-owns Ireley
OL,10,FFarm in Winchcombe, Gloucestershire.
